  "description": "<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>MountainMarkdown.com is a unique brand offering custom-designed, all-over print hoodies inspired by the beauty of outdoor adventures. With bold, eye-catching geometric patterns, our apparel reflects a passion for nature, creativity, and individuality.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>We specialize in high-quality, eco-friendly hoodies that combine comfort, durability, and stunning visuals. Each piece is carefully crafted to showcase vibrant designs, making our apparel both functional and stylish for outdoor enthusiasts and those who appreciate artistic clothing.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong><br>Our all-over print hoodies stand out with their unique outdoor-inspired themes and premium craftsmanship. Affiliates gain access to a growing, engaged customer base and an attractive 20% commission on every sale.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>Earn a 20% commission per sale, with payouts processed via debit card every 30 days. Our program includes a 30-day cookie window to maximize your earning potential.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>Affiliates will enjoy promoting a brand that values creativity, quality, and the spirit of adventure. We provide marketing tools and dedicated support to ensure your success in sharing our story.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>",
